+        fill {column: value}}]: another original copy (a PDF) of a story already in the tracker. No new row; only blank cells are filled (the links and print cells named in
+        EXTRA_FILL_OK). The PDF is kept add-only as _original_pdf/<year>/<fmt><id><o|r>-<Story ID>.pdf (a name already taken by another file gets -v2, -v3 ...) and its name is
